# Chart `[[ service.name ]]`

[[ service.description ]]

> Chart generated by forge from `forge.yml`, at the root of the repository. To
> regenerate it: `forge generate --only helm`. To receive only the evolutions of
> the template without losing your modifications: `forge update --only helm`.

| | |
|---|---|
| Chart version | `[[ domain.chart_version ]]` |
| Application version | `[[ domain.app_version ]]` |
| Supported Kubernetes | `[[ domain.kubernetes.kube_version_constraint ]]` |
| Environments | [% for env in domain.environments %]`[[ env.name ]]`[% if not loop.last %], [% endif %][% endfor %] |
| Components | [% for c in domain.components %]`[[ c.name ]]`[% if not loop.last %], [% endif %][% endfor %] |

## Installation

Each environment is deployed by layering its values file over `values.yaml`. The
order of the `--values` matters: the last one wins.

[% for env in domain.environments %]
### [[ env.name ]]

```bash
helm upgrade --install [[ service.name ]] ./charts/[[ service.name ]] \
  --namespace [[ env.namespace ]] --create-namespace \
  --values ./charts/[[ service.name ]]/values.yaml \
  --values ./charts/[[ service.name ]]/values-[[ env.name ]].yaml
```

[% endfor %]
## Structure of the chart

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| `Chart.yaml` | Metadata: name, versions, Kubernetes compatibility. |
| `values.yaml` | Default values, common to every environment. |
[% for env in domain.environments %]
| `values-[[ env.name ]].yaml` | Divergences specific to the `[[ env.name ]]` environment (namespace `[[ env.namespace ]]`). |
[% endfor %]
| `templates/_helpers.tpl` | Naming and labelling helpers, used everywhere. |
| `templates/NOTES.txt` | Message displayed after installation. |
[# The lines come from `tree.chart_files`, that is to say from the very list of
   the files forge writes: the table therefore cannot lie about the content of the
   `templates/` directory. A family enumerated by hand here would end up diverging
   as soon as a component carried one more addon. #]
[% for entry in domain.chart_files %]
[% if entry.family == "test_connection" %]
| `[[ entry.path ]]` | Test run by `helm test`. |
[% else %]
| `[[ entry.path ]]` | [[ entry.label ]] of the `[[ entry.component ]]` component. |
[% endif %]
[% endfor %]

## Values

### Global

| Key | Default | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `global.imageRegistry` | `[[ domain.image.registry ]]` | Registry common to every component. |
| `global.imagePullSecrets` | `[]` | Pull secrets for a private registry. |
| `global.environment` | `""` | Name of the environment, set as a label on the resources. |
| `nameOverride` | `""` | Replaces the name of the chart in the composed names. |
| `fullnameOverride` | `""` | Replaces the name of the resources entirely. |

[% for component in domain.components %]
