[% if component.cron is not none %]
| `[[ component.name ]].cron.schedule` | `[[ component.cron.schedule ]]` | Five-field cron schedule. |
| `[[ component.name ]].cron.concurrencyPolicy` | `[[ component.cron.concurrency_policy ]]` | `Allow`, `Forbid` or `Replace`. |
