[% if component.has.hpa %]
| `[[ component.name ]].hpa.enabled` | `false` | Autoscaling; set by the profile of each environment. |
| `[[ component.name ]].hpa.minReplicas` | `[[ component.hpa.min_replicas ]]` | Floor of replicas. |
| `[[ component.name ]].hpa.maxReplicas` | `[[ component.hpa.max_replicas ]]` | Ceiling of replicas. |
